图提供了对星系及星系中你的帝国的概览。游戏互动大多推荐使用此地图。","en":"The galaxy view provides an overview of the galaxy and your Empire within it. It is recommended for most of your interactions.","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/hud_tutorial_l_english.yml","el":13,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/hud_tutorial_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":13,"status":"paired","id":"texts:44722"},{"key":"TUTORIAL_MISSION_VIEW_TITLE","zh":"任务","en":"Missions","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/hud_tutorial_l_english.yml","el":14,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/hud_tutorial_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":14,"status":"paired","id":"texts:44723"},{"key":"TUTORIAL_MISSION_VIEW_DESC","zh":"任务窗口提供了对《Stellaris》游戏主要方面的概览，以帮助玩家确定下一步行动。","en":"The missions window provides an overview of the main aspects of Stellaris and helps you figure out what to do next.","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/hud_tutorial_l_english.yml","el":15,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/hud_tutorial_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":15,"status":"paired","id":"texts:44724"},{"key":"TUTORIAL_MISSION_VIEW_TITLE_HUDONLY","zh":"帮助菜单","en":"Help Menu","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/hud_tutorial_l_english.yml","el":16,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/hud_tutorial_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":16,"status":"paired","id":"texts:44725"},{"key":"TUTORIAL_MISSION_VIEW_DESC_HUDONLY","zh":"你可以随时在帮助菜单中访问完整的用户界面教程及游戏百科。","en":"You can always access the full user interface tutorial and the game wiki in the help menu.","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/hud_tutorial_l_english.yml","el":17,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/hud_tutorial_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":17,"status":"paired","id":"texts:44726"},{"key":"OUTLINER__SECTORS_TITLE","zh":"星域","en":"Sectors","source":"hud_tutorial","category":"界面与系统","names